      "fallback_used": false,
      "fallback_attempts": [],
      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "The old man cried. For an hour he stood perfectly still while the old man sat upright, listening. From the bed came a small groan of terror. At last, he opened the lantern a little. The narrow beam struck the eye, wide open. Then he heard it, a low, quick beating, like a watch wrapped in cotton, the old man's heart. Faster it beat and louder. What if a neighbor heard? He rushed forward with a yell. The old man shrieked once. He dragged him to the floor and pulled the heavy bed over him. For a while, the beating continued. Then silence. He hid the body beneath three floorboards and carefully fitted them back. No mark remained.",
