      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "At four in the morning came a knock. Three police officers stood outside. A neighbor had heard a shriek. He smiled and welcomed them. The cry had been his own, he explained. A bad dream. The old man was away in the country. He showed them the house, then brought chairs into the bedroom. Calm and confident, he sat directly above the hidden body. The officers settled down and chatted. A ringing troubled his ears. He spoke louder, but now the sound was clear. Low, quick, like a watch wrapped in cotton.",
